# What any package can ever be granted, in the sealed base at
# /usr/share/slopos/privd/packages; the grammar is
# slopos_package_core::ceiling's. Every install and every activation holds
# a package's grant to it. RawBlock, Mount and DacOverride can rewrite or
# cover the root, so a package granted one holds the machine.
ceiling Power Mount RawBlock NetAdmin ConsoleConfig SysInspect Clock DacOverride SchedHigh
